"With --reference, change the group of each FILE to that of RFILE.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Mainīt katra FAILA grupu uz GRUPU.\n"
"Ar --reference mainīt katra FAILA grupu uz RFILE grupu.\n"
"\n"

#: src/chown.c:115
msgid ""
"  -h, --no-dereference\n"
"         affect symbolic links instead of any referenced file;\n"
"         useful only on systems that can change the ownership of a symlink\n"
msgstr ""
"  -h, --no-dereference\n"
"         ietekmēt simboliskās saites, nevis failu, uz kuru ir atsauce;\n"
"         noderīgi tikai sistēmās, kurās var mainīt simboliskās saites īpašnieku\n"

#: src/chown.c:120
msgid ""
"      --from=CURRENT_OWNER:CURRENT_GROUP\n"
"         change the ownership of each file only if its\n"
"         current owner and/or group match those specified here.\n"
"         Either may be omitted, in which case a match\n"
"         is not required for the omitted attribute\n"
msgstr ""
"      --from=PAŠREIZĒJAIS_ĪPAŠNIEKS:PAŠREIZĒJĀ_GRUPA\n"
"         mainīt katra faila piederību tikai tad, ja tā\n"
"         pašreizējais īpašnieks un/vai grupa atbilst šeit norādītajiem.\n"
"         Jebkuru var izlaist; šādā gadījumā\n"
"         izlaistajam atribūtam atbilstība nav nepieciešama\n"

#: src/chown.c:135
msgid ""
"      --reference=RFILE\n"
"         use RFILE's ownership rather than specifying values.\n"
"         RFILE is always dereferenced if a symbolic link.\n"
msgstr ""
"      --reference=RFILE\n"
"         izmantot RFILE piederību, nevis norādīt vērtības.\n"
"         Ja RFILE ir simboliskā saite, tai vienmēr tiek sekots.\n"

#: src/chown.c:148
msgid ""
"\n"
"Owner is unchanged if missing.  Group is unchanged if missing, but changed\n"
"to login group if implied by a ':' following a symbolic OWNER.\n"
"OWNER and GROUP may be numeric as well as symbolic.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Īpašnieks netiek mainīts, ja tas nav norādīts.  Grupa netiek mainīta, ja tā nav norādīta, bet tiek mainīta\n"
"uz pieteikšanās grupu, ja to norāda ':' aiz simboliskā ĪPAŠNIEKA.\n"
"ĪPAŠNIEKS un GRUPA var būt gan skaitliski, gan simboliski.\n"

#: src/chown.c:156
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  %s root /u        Change the owner of /u to \"root\".\n"
"  %s root:staff /u  Likewise, but also change its group to \"staff\".\n"
"  %s -hR root /u    Change the owner of /u and subfiles to \"root\".\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Piemēri:\n"
"  %s root /u        Mainīt /u īpašnieku uz \"root\".\n"
"  %s root:staff /u  Līdzīgi, bet arī mainīt tā grupu uz \"staff\".\n"
"  %s -hR root /u    Mainīt /u un apakšfailu īpašnieku uz \"root\".\n"

#: src/chown.c:165
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  %s staff /u      Change the group of /u to \"staff\".\n"
"  %s -hR staff /u  Change the group of /u and subfiles to \"staff\".\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Piemēri:\n"
"  %s staff /u      Mainīt /u grupu uz \"staff\".\n"
"  %s -hR staff /u  Mainīt /u un apakšfailu grupu uz \"staff\".\n"

#. This is a proper name. See the gettext manual, section Names.
#: src/chroot.c:36
msgid "Roland McGrath"
msgstr "Rolands Makgrāts"

