msgid ""
"Output commands to set the LS_COLORS environment variable.\n"
"\n"
"Determine format of output:\n"
msgstr ""
"Izvadīt komandas LS_COLORS vides mainīgā iestatīšanai.\n"
"\n"
"Noteikt izvades formātu:\n"

#: src/dircolors.c:108
