#: src/expr.c:232
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Usage: %s EXPRESSION\n"
"  or:  %s OPTION\n"
msgstr ""
"Lietošana: %s IZTEIKSME\n"
"  vai:  %s OPCIJA\n"

#: src/expr.c:240
msgid ""
"\n"
"Print the value of EXPRESSION to standard output.  A blank line below\n"
"separates increasing precedence groups.  EXPRESSION may be:\n"
"\n"
"  ARG1 | ARG2       ARG1 if it is neither null nor 0, otherwise ARG2\n"
"\n"
"  ARG1 & ARG2       ARG1 if neither argument is null or 0, otherwise 0\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Izvadīt IZTEIKSMES vērtību standarta izvadē.  Tukša rinda zemāk\n"
"atdala augošas prioritātes grupas.  IZTEIKSME var būt:\n"
"\n"
"  ARG1 | ARG2       ARG1, ja tas nav ne null, ne 0, pretējā gadījumā ARG2\n"
"\n"
"  ARG1 & ARG2       ARG1, ja neviens arguments nav ne null, ne 0, pretējā gadījumā 0\n"

#: src/expr.c:249
msgid ""
"\n"
"  ARG1 < ARG2       ARG1 is less than ARG2\n"
"  ARG1 <= ARG2      ARG1 is less than or equal to ARG2\n"
"  ARG1 = ARG2       ARG1 is equal to ARG2\n"
"  ARG1 != ARG2      ARG1 is unequal to ARG2\n"
"  ARG1 >= ARG2      ARG1 is greater than or equal to ARG2\n"
"  ARG1 > ARG2       ARG1 is greater than ARG2\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  ARG1 < ARG2       ARG1 ir mazāks par ARG2\n"
"  ARG1 <= ARG2      ARG1 ir mazāks vai vienāds ar ARG2\n"
"  ARG1 = ARG2       ARG1 ir vienāds ar ARG2\n"
"  ARG1 != ARG2      ARG1 nav vienāds ar ARG2\n"
"  ARG1 >= ARG2      ARG1 ir lielāks vai vienāds ar ARG2\n"
"  ARG1 > ARG2       ARG1 ir lielāks par ARG2\n"

#: src/expr.c:258
msgid ""
"\n"
"  ARG1 + ARG2       arithmetic sum of ARG1 and ARG2\n"
"  ARG1 - ARG2       arithmetic difference of ARG1 and ARG2\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  ARG1 + ARG2       ARG1 un ARG2 aritmētiskā summa\n"
"  ARG1 - ARG2       ARG1 un ARG2 aritmētiskā starpība\n"

#: src/expr.c:265
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"  ARG1 * ARG2       arithmetic product of ARG1 and ARG2\n"
"  ARG1 / ARG2       arithmetic quotient of ARG1 divided by ARG2\n"
"  ARG1 % ARG2       arithmetic remainder of ARG1 divided by ARG2\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  ARG1 * ARG2       ARG1 un ARG2 aritmētiskais reizinājums\n"
"  ARG1 / ARG2       ARG1 dalījums ar ARG2\n"
"  ARG1 % ARG2       ARG1 dalījuma ar ARG2 atlikums\n"

#: src/expr.c:271
msgid ""
"\n"
"  STRING : REGEXP   anchored pattern match of REGEXP in STRING\n"
"\n"
"  match STRING REGEXP        same as STRING : REGEXP\n"
"  substr STRING POS LENGTH   substring of STRING, POS counted from 1\n"
"  index STRING CHARS         index in STRING where any CHARS is found, or 0\n"
"  length STRING              length of STRING\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  STRING : REGEXP   fiksēta REGEXP šablona meklēšana virknē VIRKNE\n"
"\n"
"  match VIRKNE REGEXP        tas pats, kas VIRKNE : REGEXP\n"
"  substr VIRKNE POZ GARUMS   VIRKNES apakšvirkne, POZ skaitot no 1\n"
"  index VIRKNE RAKST         indekss virknē VIRKNES, kur atrodama kāda no RAKSTZĪMĒM, vai 0\n"
"  length VIRKNE              VIRKNES garums\n"

#: src/expr.c:280
msgid ""
"  + TOKEN                    interpret TOKEN as a string, even if it is a\n"
"                               keyword like 'match' or an operator like '/'\n"
"\n"
"  ( EXPRESSION )             value of EXPRESSION\n"
msgstr ""
"  + TOKEN                    interpretēt TOKEN kā virkni, pat ja tas ir\n"
"                               atslēgvārds, piemēram, 'match', vai operators, piemēram, '/'\n"
"\n"
"  ( EXPRESSION )             EXPRESSION vērtība\n"

#: src/expr.c:286
msgid ""
"\n"
"Beware that many operators need to be escaped or quoted for shells.\n"
"Comparisons are arithmetic if both ARGs are numbers, else lexicographical.\n"
"Pattern matches return the string matched between \\( and \\) or null; if\n"
"\\( and \\) are not used, they return the number of characters matched or 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Ņemiet vērā, ka čaulā daudzi operatori ir jāekranē vai jāliek pēdiņās.\n"
"Salīdzinājumi ir aritmētiski, ja abi ARG ir skaitļi, pretējā gadījumā — leksikogrāfiski.\n"
"Šablona sakritības atgriež virkni, kas sakrīt starp \\( un \\), vai null; ja\n"
"\\( un \\) netiek lietoti, tiek atgriezts atbilstošo rakstzīmju skaits vai 0.\n"

#: src/expr.c:293
msgid ""
"\n"
"Exit status is 0 if EXPRESSION is neither null nor 0, 1 if EXPRESSION is null\n"
"or 0, 2 if EXPRESSION is syntactically invalid, and 3 if an error occurred.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Izejas statuss ir 0, ja EXPRESSION nav ne null, ne 0; 1, ja EXPRESSION ir null\n"
"vai 0; 2, ja EXPRESSION ir sintaktiski nederīga, un 3, ja radās kļūda.\n"

