#, c-format
msgid "warning: timer_settime"
msgstr "brīdinājums: timer_settime"

#: src/timeout.c:136
#, c-format
msgid "warning: timer_create"
msgstr "brīdinājums: timer_create"

#: src/timeout.c:162
#, c-format
msgid "warning: setitimer"
msgstr "brīdinājums: setitimer"

#: src/timeout.c:237
#, c-format
msgid "sending signal %s to command %s"
msgstr "nosūta signālu %s komandai %s"

#: src/timeout.c:270
#, c-format
msgid "Usage: %s [OPTION]... DURATION COMMAND [ARG]...\n"
msgstr "Lietošana: %s [OPCIJA]... ILGUMS KOMANDA [ARG]...\n"

#: src/timeout.c:273
msgid "Start COMMAND, and kill it if still running after DURATION.\n"
msgstr "Palaist KOMANDU un nogalināt to, ja tā joprojām darbojas pēc ILGUMA.\n"

#: src/timeout.c:279
msgid ""
"  -f, --foreground\n"
"         when not running timeout directly from a shell prompt,\n"
"         allow COMMAND to read from the TTY and get TTY signals;\n"
"         in this mode, children of COMMAND will not be timed out\n"
msgstr ""
"  -f, --foreground\n"
"         ja timeout netiek palaists tieši no čaulas uzvednes,\n"
"         ļaut KOMANDAI lasīt no TTY un saņemt TTY signālus;\n"
"         šajā režīmā KOMANDAS bērna procesiem noilgums netiks piemērots\n"

#: src/timeout.c:285
msgid ""
"  -k, --kill-after=DURATION\n"
"         also send a KILL signal if COMMAND is still running\n"
"         this long after the initial signal was sent\n"
msgstr ""
"  -k, --kill-after=ILGUMS\n"
"         nosūtīt arī KILL signālu, ja KOMANDA joprojām darbojas\n"
"         tik ilgi pēc sākotnējā signāla nosūtīšanas\n"

#: src/timeout.c:290
msgid ""
"  -p, --preserve-status\n"
"         exit with the same status as COMMAND,\n"
"         even when the command times out\n"
msgstr ""
"  -p, --preserve-status\n"
"         iziet ar tādu pašu statusu kā KOMANDA,\n"
"         pat tad, ja komandai iestājas noilgums\n"

#: src/timeout.c:295
msgid ""
"  -s, --signal=SIGNAL\n"
"         specify the signal to be sent on timeout;\n"
"         SIGNAL may be a name like 'HUP' or a number;\n"
"         see 'kill -l' for a list of signals\n"
msgstr ""
"  -s, --signal=SIGNĀLS\n"
"         norādīt signālu, ko nosūtīt noilguma gadījumā;\n"
"         SIGNĀLS var būt nosaukums, piemēram, 'HUP' vai skaitlis;\n"
"         signālu sarakstu skatiet ar 'kill -l'\n"

#: src/timeout.c:301
msgid ""
"  -v, --verbose\n"
"         diagnose to standard error any signal sent upon timeout\n"
msgstr ""
"  -v, --verbose\n"
"         standarta kļūdu izvadē ziņot par jebkuru noilguma nosūtīto signālu\n"

#: src/timeout.c:309
msgid ""
"\n"
"DURATION is a floating point number with an optional suffix:\n"
"'s' for seconds (the default), 'm' for minutes, 'h' for hours or 'd' for days.\n"
"A duration of 0 disables the associated timeout.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ILGUMS ir peldošā komata skaitlis ar neobligātu sufiksu:\n"
"'s' sekundēm (noklusējums), 'm' minūtēm, 'h' stundām vai 'd' dienām.\n"
"Ilgums 0 atspējo saistīto taimautu.\n"

#: src/timeout.c:314
msgid ""
"\n"
"Upon timeout, send the TERM signal to COMMAND, if no other SIGNAL specified.\n"
"The TERM signal kills any process that does not block or catch that signal.\n"
"It may be necessary to use the KILL signal, since this signal can't be caught.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Pēc noilguma nosūtīt TERM signālu KOMANDAI, ja nav norādīts cits SIGNĀLS.\n"
"TERM signāls pārtrauc jebkuru procesu, kas nebloķē vai neuztver šo signālu.\n"
"Var būt nepieciešams izmantot KILL signālu, jo šo signālu nevar uztvert.\n"

#: src/timeout.c:320
msgid ""
"\n"
"Exit status:\n"
"  124  if COMMAND times out, and --preserve-status is not specified\n"
"  125  if the timeout command itself fails\n"
"  126  if COMMAND is found but cannot be invoked\n"
"  127  if COMMAND cannot be found\n"
"  137  if COMMAND (or timeout itself) is sent the KILL (9) signal (128+9)\n"
"  -    the exit status of COMMAND otherwise\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Iziešanas statuss:\n"
"  124  ja iestājas KOMANDAS noilgums un --preserve-status nav norādīts\n"
"  125  ja pati timeout komanda neizdodas\n"
"  126  ja KOMANDA ir atrasta, bet to nevar izsaukt\n"
"  127  ja KOMANDA nav atrasta\n"
"  137  ja KOMANDAI (vai pašai timeout komandai) tiek nosūtīts KILL (9) signāls (128+9)\n"
"  -    citos gadījumos — KOMANDAS iziešanas statuss\n"

#: src/timeout.c:400 src/timeout.c:481
#, c-format
msgid "warning: sigprocmask"
msgstr "brīdinājums: sigprocmask"

#: src/timeout.c:503
#, c-format
msgid "warning: disabling core dumps failed"
msgstr "brīdinājums: neizdevās atspējot atmiņas izmetes"

#: src/timeout.c:603
#, c-format
msgid "fork system call failed"
msgstr "neizdevās sistēmas izsaukums fork"

#: src/timeout.c:621
#, c-format
msgid "child failed to reset signal mask"
msgstr "bērna procesam neizdevās atiestatīt signālu masku"

#: src/timeout.c:653
#, c-format
msgid "error waiting for command"
msgstr "kļūda, gaidot komandu"

#: src/timeout.c:664
#, c-format
msgid "the monitored command dumped core"
msgstr "uzraudzītā komanda izveidoja atmiņas izgāzumu"

#: src/timeout.c:682
#, c-format
msgid "unknown status from command (%d)"
msgstr "nezināms komandas statuss (%d)"

